      "source": "sections/sec-011-cryptococcal-meningitis.md",
      "source_hash": "b1670247ba8cee1c7cca9ad386ed214e66f54d7d5856c46423aeeed2a16d67d9",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Gives the preferred one-week amphotericin B and flucytosine induction regimen for cryptococcal meningitis in children with HIV.",
