    {
      "block": "library/10665-332907/blocks/prose-sec-016",
      "source": "sections/sec-016-preventing-tb-pneumocystis-pneumonia-bacterial-i.md",
      "source_hash": "3b79a7885ce09dae8839fc1c8eb8c6c1cf1840777840a998f9fba4fe23fbcc64",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Covers TB preventive treatment for children with HIV, including the restricted use in infants without a TB contact and the preferred six-month isoniazid regimen with pyridoxine. It describes shorter rifampicin- or rifapentine-based options, their interactions with antiretroviral drugs in a summary table, and related resources.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-332907/blocks/prose-sec-017",
      "source": "sections/sec-017-pcp-and-other-infections.md",
      "source_hash": "7f541158a0cf306763d73bf5c51512a66cf385cca706518dea3daea66ac600bd",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Reviews evidence on co-trimoxazole prophylaxis to prevent Pneumocystis pneumonia and other infections in children with HIV and when it may be stopped. It also addresses fluconazole and cryptococcal antigen screening for adolescents, including lumbar puncture for those who test positive.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-332907/blocks/prose-sec-018",
      "source": "sections/sec-018-vaccinations.md",
      "source_hash": "bca095b989ebfd3af15dd1ba9ac3fac779f122df411218cb2687d64bf350bef8",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out vaccination guidance for children with HIV, focusing on BCG, human papillomavirus, measles and pneumococcal vaccines, including timing relative to antiretroviral therapy and immune recovery. It notes differences in BCG practice between countries and gives revaccination and catch-up advice. A case study describes scaling up the advanced HIV disease package for children in Malawi using a hub-and-spoke model and the challenges encountered.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-332907/blocks/prose-sec-020",
      "source": "sections/sec-020-national-level.md",
      "source_hash": "2fb13a6b14a6d64325194a6202797b7e04de8743131210ab592b92b8bbd908c1",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Lists national-level implementation steps, such as adopting the guidelines, aligning HIV, TB and child health guidance, procuring child formulations and enabling catch-up vaccination.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
