        {
          "text": "Lists clinical research gaps in diagnostics, prophylaxis and treatment for children with advanced HIV disease, such as point-of-care pneumonia tests, the role of azithromycin and shorter TB preventive regimens. It also mentions ongoing studies of cryptococcal meningitis treatment that may inform care of older children.",
